{"text": "THREE RIVERS RECOVERY & PRIMARY CARE                 42 CFR Part 2 PROTECTED RECORD\nOBOT FOLLOW-UP                                          DOS: 11/03/2026\n\nPT: LEMIEUX, DAKOTA R.     DOB: 6-19-1994     MRN: TRR-0091447\nIns: San Juan Basin Health Plan (Medicaid MCO), ID# SJB 4471 882 06\nProvider: Efua Mensah-Boateng, FNP-BC   NPI 1881447203   DEA MM2204718\n\nS: 32 y/o here for monthly f/u, OUD, severe, in early remission (ICD-10 F11.20).\nOn bup/nx 8-2 mg SL BID x 7 mos. Denies cravings most days. One slip:\nused fentanyl pills x1 on 10/17 after an argument w/ sister April; no OD,\ntold his sponsor next day. No IV use since March. Sleeping 5-6 hrs. Mood\n\"flat but OK.\" Working 30 hrs/wk at a tire shop. Living at Animas Sober Living\n(Farmington) since 8/1/26; house manager does random UDS too.\nTobacco 1/2 ppd. EtOH: denies. Cannabis: \"a couple times a month.\"\nHep C Ab+ (dx 2023), RNA pending. HIV neg 5/2026.\nLegal: on probation through 2027, San Juan County, poss. of controlled substance. PO is\nCurtis Yellowhorse, 505-555-0127; pt signed release for attendance + UDS\nresults only, NOT the note.\n\nO: BP 122/78, HR 74, wt 168. COWS 2. Alert, well groomed, no track marks.\nPHQ-9 = 11 (was 16 in Aug). No SI/HI.\nUDS today (cup, lot 4471B): bup +, norbup +, fentanyl NEG, THC +, all else neg.\nPDMP checked: no other controlled Rx.\n\nA/P:\n1. OUD -- continue buprenorphine-naloxone 8/2 mg film, 1 BID, #56, 0 RF.\n   eRx to Mesa Verde Community Pharmacy, 2101 E. 20th St, Farmington NM 87401,\n   Rx # 7044718. Pharmacist (Sandoval) had questions last month about\n   early fill; ok to fill 11/3.\n2. MDD, moderate -- start sertraline 50 mg qAM. Declines counseling referral\n   again; will revisit.\n3. Hep C -- RNA + genotype drawn today. If viremic, treat here.\n4. Narcan 4 mg nasal x2 dispensed; April trained on use.\n5. Housing: sober-living fee $140/wk; he is behind $280. Referred to\n   peer navigator for the county voucher.\n6. RTC q4wk. Next: 12/1/2026 10:20.\n\nContact: pt cell (505) 555-0183 -- OK to leave msg w/ first name only.\nEmergency contact: sister, April Lemieux, 505.555.0159. Do NOT contact\nhis father (pt request).\nBilling: CPT 99214. No copay.\n\nElectronically signed: E. Mensah-Boateng FNP-BC  11/03/2026 16:52", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "366 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Lemieux, Dakota R.", "Efua Mensah-Boateng", "Curtis Yellowhorse", "April", "April Lemieux"], "companies": ["San Juan Basin Health Plan", "Mesa Verde Community Pharmacy", "Sober Living", "San Juan County", "CPT"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Animas Sober Living", "Farmington", "San Juan County", "Mesa Verde Community Pharmacy", "Denver", "San Juan Basin Health Plan"], "health": ["OUD", "severe", "early remission", "buprenorphine-naloxone", "Hep C Ab+", "RNA", "HIV neg", "PDMP", "MDD", "moderate", "sertraline", "Narcan", "RTC", "CPT 99214"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Dakota", "Lemieux", "Efua", "Curtis", "April", "Sandoval"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 36, "text": "THREE RIVERS RECOVERY & PRIMARY CARE", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "THREE RIVERS RECOVERY & PRIMARY CARE"}, {"start": 140, "end": 155, "text": "DOS: 11/03/2026", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "DOS: 11/03/2026"}, {"start": 161, "end": 179, "text": "LEMIEUX, DAKOTA R.", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Lemieux, Dakota R."}, {"start": 189, "end": 198, "text": "6-19